1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,730
Video ya leo inahusu nini? Ni kuhusu mchakato mbalimbali wa kufanya. Inaonekana ngumu, sivyo?

2
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:23,015
Katika sehemu fulani ya video, utaona swali linatoka kwa Kijapani. Ukishakielewa, tafadhali ujaze kwenye maoni. Sehemu ya 1: Usajili wa Anwani / Mchakato wa Usajili wa Makazi

3
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:25,055
Samahani.

4
00:00:25,078 --> 00:00:28,645
Nimefika hivi karibuni nchini Japani.

5
00:00:28,668 --> 00:00:32,101
Ningependa kusajili anwani yangu.

6
00:00:32,124 --> 00:00:34,324
Karibu.

7
00:00:34,347 --> 00:00:37,044
Karibu kwenye ofisi ya manispaa.

8
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:40,001
Unataka kusajili anwani mpya, ndiyo?

9
00:00:40,024 --> 00:00:42,763
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

10
00:00:42,786 --> 00:00:45,753
Nina wasiwasi sana.

11
00:00:45,776 --> 00:00:48,176
Usijali, hakuna matata.

12
00:00:48,199 --> 00:00:53,888
Kwanza, naomba unionyeshe kadi yako ya kukaa na pasipoti.

13
00:00:53,911 --> 00:00:56,525
Ndiyo, nina nazo.

14
00:00:56,548 --> 00:01:00,243
Nitazitoa kwenye begi yangu.

15
00:01:00,267 --> 00:01:02,200
Hizi ndizo.

16
00:01:02,223 --> 00:01:04,390
Tafadhali.

17
00:01:04,413 --> 00:01:06,079
Asante sana.

18
00:01:06,102 --> 00:01:08,302
Nitazichukua kwa muda.

19
00:01:08,325 --> 00:01:11,532
Umefika lini nchini Japani?

20
00:01:11,556 --> 00:01:15,322
Niliwasili Ijumaa iliyopita.

21
00:01:15,345 --> 00:01:17,351
Sawa, nimeelewa.

22
00:01:17,375 --> 00:01:22,648
Sasa, tafadhali jaza fomu hii inayoitwa 'Teni-nyū todoke'.

23
00:01:22,671 --> 00:01:24,485
Sawa.

24
00:01:24,508 --> 00:01:27,766
Nina swali.

25
00:01:27,790 --> 00:01:32,362
Furigana juu ya jina ni nini?

26
00:01:32,385 --> 00:01:36,385
Ni jinsi ya kusoma jina lako.

27
00:01:36,408 --> 00:01:38,411
Andika kwa Katakana.

28
00:01:38,435 --> 00:01:40,968
Katakana, ndiyo.

29
00:01:40,991 --> 00:01:43,127
Sawa, nimeelewa.

30
00:01:43,151 --> 00:01:47,984
Andika jina la nchi yako na jina lako la sasa.

31
00:01:48,007 --> 00:01:49,578
Sawa.

32
00:01:49,602 --> 00:01:52,369
Ninaandikia wapi anwani?

33
00:01:52,392 --> 00:01:55,792
Andika ndani ya fremu pana hii.

34
00:01:55,814 --> 00:01:59,110
Ni anwani ya ghorofa mpya yangu.

35
00:01:59,133 --> 00:02:01,023
Sawa, nimeelewa.

36
00:02:01,047 --> 00:02:05,280
Kanji za anwani ni ngumu sana.

37
00:02:05,303 --> 00:02:09,336
Naomba nikae nikijaza huku nikitazama skrini ya simu yangu?

38
00:02:09,359 --> 00:02:12,833
Ndiyo, hakuna shida.

39
00:02:12,857 --> 00:02:15,756
Andika polepole na kwa uangalifu.

40
00:02:15,779 --> 00:02:18,232
Asante sana.

41
00:02:18,256 --> 00:02:21,432
Anwani za Japani ni ndefu sana!

42
00:02:21,456 --> 00:02:24,989
Je, naandike namba ya chumba pia?

43
00:02:25,012 --> 00:02:26,587
Sawa.

44
00:02:26,611 --> 00:02:31,944
Jina la ghorofa na namba ya chumba ni muhimu, basi andika.

45
00:02:31,967 --> 00:02:34,100
Sawa, nimeelewa.

46
00:02:34,123 --> 00:02:37,400
Chumba cha 302, ndiyo.

47
00:02:37,424 --> 00:02:39,459
Nimeandika.

48
00:02:39,482 --> 00:02:41,215
Asante sana.

49
00:02:41,238 --> 00:02:45,272
Andika tarehe ya kuzaliwa na namba ya simu hapa pia.

50
00:02:45,296 --> 00:02:49,829
Bado sina namba ya simu ya Japani.

51
00:02:49,852 --> 00:02:52,419
Nifanyeje?

52
00:02:52,442 --> 00:02:54,486
Nimeelewa.

53
00:02:54,509 --> 00:02:59,276
Je, una namba ya simu ya shule au kazi?

54
00:02:59,299 --> 00:03:00,934
Sawa.

55
00:03:00,958 --> 00:03:04,134
Nina namba ya simu ya shule ya Kijapani.

56
00:03:04,157 --> 00:03:06,209
Nitaandika hiyo.

57
00:03:06,232 --> 00:03:09,524
Sawa, itakuwa sawa.

58
00:03:09,548 --> 00:03:11,238
Nimekamilisha.

59
00:03:11,262 --> 00:03:13,541
Hii ni yote?

60
00:03:13,564 --> 00:03:16,331
Tafadhali angalia.

61
00:03:16,354 --> 00:03:19,120
Ndiyo, nionyeshe.

62
00:03:19,143 --> 00:03:24,943
Jina, anwani, tarehe ya kuzaliwa na nambari ya shule, ndio hivi?

63
00:03:24,966 --> 00:03:27,263
Kamili kabisa.

64
00:03:27,287 --> 00:03:29,663
Sawa, nzuri sana.

65
00:03:29,686 --> 00:03:31,620
Nimefarijika.

66
00:03:31,644 --> 00:03:35,012
Sasa nitakagua kadi yako.

67
00:03:35,035 --> 00:03:39,602
Tafadhali kaa kwenye kiti hicho cha buluu na subiri.

68
00:03:39,625 --> 00:03:43,832
Ndiyo, itachukua muda gani?

69
00:03:43,855 --> 00:03:46,822
Itachukua dakika kama kumi na tano.

70
00:03:46,845 --> 00:03:50,742
Nitakuita kwa jina lako, basi subiri.

71
00:03:50,766 --> 00:03:52,569
Sawa, nimeelewa.

72
00:03:52,592 --> 00:03:55,392
Nitakaa na kusubiri.

73
00:03:55,415 --> 00:03:57,415
Umesubiriwa.

74
00:03:57,439 --> 00:04:00,206
Nakuwarudishe kadi yako ya kukaa.

75
00:04:00,229 --> 00:04:01,847
Asante sana.

76
00:04:01,871 --> 00:04:04,638
Tazama upande wa nyuma wa kadi.

77
00:04:04,661 --> 00:04:08,795
Anwani mpya imeandikwa hapa.

78
00:04:08,818 --> 00:04:11,754
Eeh, kweli ndivyo!

79
00:04:11,777 --> 00:04:16,453
Jina langu na anwani mpya zipo vizuri.

80
00:04:16,477 --> 00:04:19,317
Nafurahi sana.

81
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:21,174
Vizuri sana.

82
00:04:21,197 --> 00:04:25,163
Hivyo ndivyo mwisho wa usajili wa makazi.

83
00:04:25,186 --> 00:04:26,820
Asante sana.

84
00:04:26,843 --> 00:04:30,914
Nimefurahi sana kwa kuniongoza vizuri.

85
00:04:30,938 --> 00:04:33,415
La, asante.

86
00:04:33,438 --> 00:04:36,576
Hii si mwisho bado.

87
00:04:36,599 --> 00:04:42,268
Kisha nenda dirishani upande wa pili kufanya usajili wa bima ya afya.

88
00:04:42,292 --> 00:04:45,492
Aa, bima ya afya?

89
00:04:45,515 --> 00:04:47,482
Sawa, nimeelewa.

90
00:04:47,505 --> 00:04:50,105
Dirisha upande wa pili, ndio hiyo.

91
00:04:50,128 --> 00:04:52,195
Nitakwenda sasa.

92
00:04:52,217 --> 00:04:59,323
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

93
00:04:59,323 --> 00:05:02,323
Sehemu ya 2: Usajili wa Bima ya Afya

94
00:05:02,323 --> 00:05:04,756
Samahani.

95
00:05:04,779 --> 00:05:11,462
Nilisemwa nifanye usajili wa bima ya afya kwenye dirisha upande wa pili.

96
00:05:11,486 --> 00:05:14,185
Karibu.

97
00:05:14,209 --> 00:05:18,675
Ni usajili wa bima ya afya ya kitaifa.

98
00:05:18,698 --> 00:05:22,632
Tafadhali nionyeshe kadi yako ya kukaa iliyokuwa hapo awali.

99
00:05:22,655 --> 00:05:25,126
Hii ndiyo.

100
00:05:25,149 --> 00:05:28,389
Hivi karibuni uliandikia anwani.

101
00:05:28,412 --> 00:05:30,079
Asante sana.

102
00:05:30,103 --> 00:05:32,147
Nitaangalia.

103
00:05:32,170 --> 00:05:37,304
Bima ya afya ni muhimu sana katika maisha ya Japani.

104
00:05:37,326 --> 00:05:40,393
Ndiyo, najua.

105
00:05:40,416 --> 00:05:45,216
Lakini sistimu ya bima sijui vizuri.

106
00:05:45,239 --> 00:05:47,082
Usijali, nitaeleza.

107
00:05:47,106 --> 00:05:48,981
Nitaeleza.

108
00:05:49,004 --> 00:05:54,093
Ukitumbukia nchini Japani, huenda hospitalini, sivyo?

109
00:05:54,117 --> 00:05:55,650
Sawa.

110
00:05:55,673 --> 00:05:59,540
Kukutwa na ugonjwa ni jambo linalosumbua sana.

111
00:05:59,564 --> 00:06:02,932
Je, gharama ni nyingi?

112
00:06:02,956 --> 00:06:09,189
Kadi hii ya bima ya afya itakupunguzia gharama unapozihitaji hospitalini.

113
00:06:09,212 --> 00:06:12,709
Utalipa theluthi moja tu ya gharama zote.

114
00:06:12,732 --> 00:06:15,400
Theluthi moja tu?

115
00:06:15,424 --> 00:06:19,912
Je, si lazima nizipie sehemu iliyobaki ya asilimia sabini?

116
00:06:19,935 --> 00:06:23,935
Ndiyo, sehemu iliyobaki italipwa na serikali.

117
00:06:23,958 --> 00:06:27,292
Kwa hiyo, unaweza kuwa na amani kabisa.

118
00:06:27,315 --> 00:06:29,786
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

119
00:06:29,809 --> 00:06:32,463
Nimepata polepole raha kidogo.

120
00:06:32,487 --> 00:06:38,181
Lakini, lazima kulipa pesa ya bima kila mwezi.

121
00:06:38,204 --> 00:06:41,238
Eeh, kila mwezi?

122
00:06:41,261 --> 00:06:43,757
Inagharimu pesa ngapi hivi?

123
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:49,264
Mimi ni mwanafunzi wa kigeni, na sina pesa nyingi.

124
00:06:49,288 --> 00:06:52,154
Usijali, hakuna matata.

125
00:06:52,177 --> 00:06:58,650
Wakati wa mapato ya kazi ndogo yanaisha au unapokuwa mwanafunzi, ada ya bima inapungua.

126
00:06:58,674 --> 00:07:00,807
Inapungua?

127
00:07:00,830 --> 00:07:02,763
Sawa, nzuri sana.

128
00:07:02,786 --> 00:07:06,521
Unaweza kunijulisha sasa ni pesa ngapi?

129
00:07:06,545 --> 00:07:12,378
Mwaka jana sikuwa nipo Japani, kwa hiyo nitalipa ada ndogo zaidi.

130
00:07:12,401 --> 00:07:15,568
Kila mwezi ni takribani yenye shilingi elfu mbili (2000).

131
00:07:15,591 --> 00:07:18,265
Kila mwezi shilingi elfu mbili?

132
00:07:18,288 --> 00:07:22,455
Kama ni hivyo, nitaweza kulipa.

133
00:07:22,478 --> 00:07:24,693
Sawa, nzuri sana.

134
00:07:24,717 --> 00:07:29,599
Sasa nitakueleza jinsi ya kulipa pesa hizo.

135
00:07:29,623 --> 00:07:31,889
Sawa, naomba.

136
00:07:31,912 --> 00:07:35,180
Je, pesa zitatolewa moja kwa moja kutoka benki?

137
00:07:35,204 --> 00:07:41,887
Unaweza kusajili benki, lakini mwanzo utapokea karatasi inayoitwa 'hati ya malipo' kwa njia ya posta.

138
00:07:41,910 --> 00:07:44,527
Hati ya malipo?

139
00:07:44,550 --> 00:07:46,962
Hiyo ni nini?

140
00:07:46,986 --> 00:07:50,046
Karatasi yenye barakoodi.

141
00:07:50,069 --> 00:07:54,603
Karatasi hiyo itakutumwa kwa posta kila mwezi nyumbani kwako.

142
00:07:54,626 --> 00:07:59,863
Nitakapokuwa na karatasi hiyo, nitakwenda wapi kulipa pesa?

143
00:07:59,887 --> 00:08:01,723
Benki?

144
00:08:01,746 --> 00:08:08,146
Unaweza kulipa benki, lakini duka la karibu (konbini) ndilo rahisi zaidi.

145
00:08:08,169 --> 00:08:11,369
Unaweza kulipa wakati wowote, saa 24.

146
00:08:11,392 --> 00:08:15,392
Je, ninaweza kulipa duka la karibu?

147
00:08:15,415 --> 00:08:18,215
Hiyo ni rahisi sana!

148
00:08:18,238 --> 00:08:24,238
Ndiyo, onesha karatasi kwa mfanyakazi wa duka na ulipe pesa.

149
00:08:24,261 --> 00:08:28,294
Kuna muda uliowekwa, basi angalia vizuri.

150
00:08:28,317 --> 00:08:30,517
Sawa, nimeelewa.

151
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:34,674
Nitakapopokea karatasi, nitakwenda mara moja dukani.

152
00:08:34,697 --> 00:08:37,030
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

153
00:08:37,053 --> 00:08:41,853
Sasa tutaendelea na mchakato, subiri kidogo.

154
00:08:41,876 --> 00:08:44,209
Sawa, naomba.

155
00:08:44,232 --> 00:08:46,365
Umesubiriwa.

156
00:08:46,388 --> 00:08:52,755
Hii ni kadi yako ya Ulinzi wa Afya ya Kitaifa.

157
00:08:52,778 --> 00:08:56,551
Jina lake ni refu, lakini tunaiita kadi ya bima.

158
00:08:56,574 --> 00:08:59,210
Hii ndiyo kadi ya bima?

159
00:08:59,234 --> 00:09:02,234
Kadi ndogo sana!

160
00:09:02,257 --> 00:09:04,031
Sawa.

161
00:09:04,054 --> 00:09:09,054
Unapokwenda hospitali, hakikisha unabeba kadi hii.

162
00:09:09,077 --> 00:09:12,087
Ni vizuri kuiweka kwenye pochi yako.

163
00:09:12,111 --> 00:09:13,758
Sawa, nimeelewa.

164
00:09:13,781 --> 00:09:16,955
Nitaweka kwenye pochi yangu daima.

165
00:09:16,979 --> 00:09:20,313
Unaweza kuiutumia kuanzia leo.

166
00:09:20,336 --> 00:09:24,913
Jitaharishe afya yako na ufurahie maisha ya Japani.

167
00:09:24,936 --> 00:09:26,419
Sawa.

168
00:09:26,443 --> 00:09:31,410
Asante sana kwa kunieleza vizuri.

169
00:09:31,432 --> 00:09:34,832
La, karibu.

170
00:09:34,855 --> 00:09:39,624
Kama una tatizo lolote, rudi tena wakati wowote.

171
00:09:39,648 --> 00:09:42,490
Ndiyo, nitakuja tena.

172
00:09:42,513 --> 00:09:44,551
Kwa heri.

173
00:09:44,575 --> 00:09:53,654
Ukiielewa, tafadhali uandike maoni.

174
00:09:53,654 --> 00:09:56,654
Sehemu ya 3: Kufungua Akaunti ya Benki

175
00:09:56,654 --> 00:09:59,134
Samahani.

176
00:09:59,157 --> 00:10:03,976
Ninataka kufungua akaunti mpya ya benki.

177
00:10:03,999 --> 00:10:05,999
Karibu.

178
00:10:06,022 --> 00:10:09,155
Kufungua akaunti mpya, basi?

179
00:10:09,178 --> 00:10:14,178
Leo unataka kufungua akaunti kwa madhumuni gani?

180
00:10:14,201 --> 00:10:19,535
Ninahitaji kwa sababu nitaanza kazi ya kibarua hapa Japani.

181
00:10:19,558 --> 00:10:21,173
Nimeelewa.

182
00:10:21,196 --> 00:10:27,045
Kwa ajili ya kupewa mshahara wa kazi ya kibarua na gharama za maisha kila mwezi, ndiyo?

183
00:10:27,068 --> 00:10:30,354
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

184
00:10:30,378 --> 00:10:36,429
Mtu wa kampuni aliniambia nifungue akaunti katika benki hii.

185
00:10:36,452 --> 00:10:38,622
Nimeelewa.

186
00:10:38,645 --> 00:10:43,423
Kwanza, tutakuhakikishia utambulisho wako.

187
00:10:43,447 --> 00:10:47,724
Una kitambulisho chako cha kukaa na pasipoti?

188
00:10:47,748 --> 00:10:50,518
Ndiyo, nimezileta.

189
00:10:50,542 --> 00:10:53,575
Nitazitoa kwenye begi yangu.

190
00:10:53,598 --> 00:10:55,845
Hizi ndizo.

191
00:10:55,868 --> 00:10:57,668
Tafadhali.

192
00:10:57,691 --> 00:10:59,294
Asante sana.

193
00:10:59,318 --> 00:11:01,752
Nitazichukua kwa muda.

194
00:11:01,775 --> 00:11:05,775
Muda wa kukaa unaoonekana una hakuna tatizo.

195
00:11:05,798 --> 00:11:11,642
Sasa, tafadhali jaza jina lako na anwani yako kwenye fomu hii ya maombi.

196
00:11:11,665 --> 00:11:13,279
Sawa.

197
00:11:13,303 --> 00:11:16,403
Andika kwa kanji na katakana.

198
00:11:16,426 --> 00:11:18,598
Tafadhali, nisaidie.

199
00:11:18,621 --> 00:11:23,838
Eeh, mteja, leo una stampu (hanko)?.

200
00:11:23,862 --> 00:11:25,531
Eh?

201
00:11:25,554 --> 00:11:27,600
Stampu (hanko)?

202
00:11:27,624 --> 00:11:31,190
Samahani, sijaziileta.

203
00:11:31,213 --> 00:11:33,291
Nitafanya nini sasa?

204
00:11:33,315 --> 00:11:38,353
Kama sina stampu, je, siwezi kufungua akaunti?

205
00:11:38,376 --> 00:11:41,748
Aa, hakuna matatizo.

206
00:11:41,772 --> 00:11:44,505
Usijali sana.

207
00:11:44,528 --> 00:11:50,528
Hapa katika duka letu, unaweza kujisajili kwa kutumia sahihi badala ya stampu.

208
00:11:50,551 --> 00:11:52,751
Kweli?

209
00:11:52,774 --> 00:11:55,049
Vizuri sana.

210
00:11:55,073 --> 00:11:57,342
Nilikuwa nimehofia sana.

211
00:11:57,365 --> 00:12:01,932
La, hakuna matatizo.

212
00:12:01,955 --> 00:12:09,760
Sasa, tafadhali andika sahihi yako katika mraba wa sehemu ya 'Stampu ya Anwani' hii.

213
00:12:09,784 --> 00:12:13,226
Je, ni vyema kutumia sahihi ile ile ya pasipoti?

214
00:12:13,249 --> 00:12:14,816
Sawa.

215
00:12:14,839 --> 00:12:17,805
Tafadhali tumia ile ile ya pasipoti.

216
00:12:17,828 --> 00:12:19,795
Sawa, nimeelewa.

217
00:12:19,819 --> 00:12:22,954
Nimeandika ndani ya mraba.

218
00:12:22,977 --> 00:12:25,344
Hii ni sawa?

219
00:12:25,367 --> 00:12:28,985
Ndiyo, umeandika vizuri.

220
00:12:29,009 --> 00:12:30,891
Asante sana.

221
00:12:30,914 --> 00:12:35,728
Sasa, tafadhali chagua nambari ya siri ya kadi yako ya fedha.

222
00:12:35,752 --> 00:12:38,886
Nambari ya siri?

223
00:12:38,909 --> 00:12:41,242
Hiyo ni nini?

224
00:12:41,265 --> 00:12:46,398
Ni nambari ya siri ya tarakimu nne unayotumia wakati wa kutumia kadi.

225
00:12:46,421 --> 00:12:48,438
Sawa, nimeelewa.

226
00:12:48,462 --> 00:12:51,429
Nambari nne, basi.

227
00:12:51,452 --> 00:12:53,028
Sawa.

228
00:12:53,051 --> 00:12:59,686
Tafadhali ingiza nambari mara mbili kwenye mashine hii nyeusi ili mtu yeyote asione.

229
00:12:59,710 --> 00:13:07,756
Usitumie tarehe ya kuzaliwa au nambari rahisi kama 1234, fahamu.

230
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:09,913
Sawa, nimeelewa.

231
00:13:09,936 --> 00:13:13,829
Nitaingiza nambari yangu ya siri.

232
00:13:13,853 --> 00:13:15,629
Nimekamilisha.

233
00:13:15,652 --> 00:13:17,285
Asante sana.

234
00:13:17,308 --> 00:13:21,750
Tutakamilisha mchakato, tafadhali subiri kwenye kiti pale.

235
00:13:21,774 --> 00:13:24,387
Sawa, nimeelewa.

236
00:13:24,411 --> 00:13:27,078
Tafadhali, nisaidie.

237
00:13:27,100 --> 00:13:29,900
Umechelewa kidogo.

238
00:13:29,923 --> 00:13:34,457
Hii ni daftari la akaunti yako mpya na kadi ya fedha.

239
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:36,556
Aa, asante sana.

240
00:13:36,579 --> 00:13:40,713
Sasa nitapokea pesa za kazi yangu ya kibarua.

241
00:13:40,736 --> 00:13:42,944
Ni vizuri sana.

242
00:13:42,967 --> 00:13:46,540
Jitahidi katika maisha yako hapa Japani.

243
00:13:46,563 --> 00:13:48,163
Sawa.

244
00:13:48,186 --> 00:13:52,919
Asante sana kwa kunisaidia kwa upole.

245
00:13:52,942 --> 00:13:55,676
La, karibu.

246
00:13:55,699 --> 00:13:58,567
Rudi salama nyumbani.

247
00:13:58,590 --> 00:14:01,590
Sehemu ya 4: Mwongozo wa Mkataba wa Kadi SIM / Mwongozo wa Mwanzo kwa Mikataba ya Kadi SIM nchini Japani

248
00:14:01,590 --> 00:14:03,357
Samahani.

249
00:14:03,380 --> 00:14:07,380
Ninataka kutumia simu ya Japani.

250
00:14:07,403 --> 00:14:11,485
Je, naweza kufanya mkataba wa kadi SIM mpya?

251
00:14:11,509 --> 00:14:13,542
Karibu.

252
00:14:13,565 --> 00:14:17,198
Ndiyo, bila shaka unaweza.

253
00:14:17,221 --> 00:14:21,021
Unataka kufanya mkataba wa kadi SIM mpya, ndiyo?

254
00:14:21,044 --> 00:14:23,411
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

255
00:14:23,434 --> 00:14:29,867
Nimefika hivi karibuni nchini Japani, na ninahitaji nambari ya simu ya Japani.

256
00:14:29,890 --> 00:14:31,724
Sawa, nimeelewa.

257
00:14:31,746 --> 00:14:38,380
Basi, kwanza tutaamua mpango wa kiasi cha data unachohitaji.

258
00:14:38,403 --> 00:14:47,650
Dukani kwetu, tuna mipango ya 3GB, 10GB, 30GB, na mpango usio na kikomo.

259
00:14:47,674 --> 00:14:51,874
Eeh, GB?

260
00:14:51,897 --> 00:14:57,230
Majina ya mipango ni magumu, sijui vizuri.

261
00:14:57,253 --> 00:15:03,220
Kuna kanji na Kiingereza nyingi, naona kichwa kinaniuma.

262
00:15:03,243 --> 00:15:06,981
Haha, usijali.

263
00:15:07,004 --> 00:15:09,204
Ni magumu, ndiyo.

264
00:15:09,227 --> 00:15:11,960
Tutafikiria polepole.

265
00:15:11,983 --> 00:15:17,983
Je, unapenda kutazama video kwenye YouTube na kadhalika wakati wa nje?

266
00:15:18,006 --> 00:15:24,773
Ndiyo, naona video nyingi za YouTube za Kijapani kila siku.

267
00:15:24,796 --> 00:15:28,963
Ninahitaji kuona kwa ajili ya masomo, wakati wowote.

268
00:15:28,986 --> 00:15:31,319
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

269
00:15:31,342 --> 00:15:39,742
Kwa hiyo, mipango ya 3GB au 10GB itaisha haraka sana.

270
00:15:39,765 --> 00:15:46,535
Ikiwa unataka kutazama video bila wasiwasi wowote, mpango wa 30GB ndio bora zaidi.

271
00:15:46,558 --> 00:15:49,172
30GB, basi?

272
00:15:49,195 --> 00:15:52,195
Hiyo itanipa amani ya akili.

273
00:15:52,218 --> 00:15:54,917
Nitachagua mpango huo.

274
00:15:54,941 --> 00:16:00,193
Nimechagua vizuri na ninafurahi sana.

275
00:16:00,216 --> 00:16:02,289
Sawa, nzuri sana.

276
00:16:02,312 --> 00:16:08,346
Sasa, tafadhali nionyeshe kadi yako ya kukaa ili tuanze mchakato.

277
00:16:08,369 --> 00:16:10,535
Hii ndiyo.

278
00:16:10,558 --> 00:16:12,125
Tafadhali.

279
00:16:12,148 --> 00:16:14,046
Asante sana.

280
00:16:14,069 --> 00:16:20,113
Je, una kadi ya mkopo kwa kulipa ada ya kila mwezi?

281
00:16:20,136 --> 00:16:25,977
Ndiyo, nina kadi ya mkopo ya nchi yangu, je inaweza kutumika?

282
00:16:26,001 --> 00:16:33,080
Ndiyo, ikiwa ina alama ya brandi ya kimataifa, hata kadi za nje zinaweza kutumika.

283
00:16:33,103 --> 00:16:35,037
Sawa, nzuri sana.

284
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:36,527
Hizi ndizo.

285
00:16:36,551 --> 00:16:37,837
Tafadhali.

286
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:40,460
Nitazichukua kwa muda.

287
00:16:40,483 --> 00:16:43,576
Ndiyo, nimeithibitisha.

288
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:49,738
Sasa, tafadhali angalia hati ya mkataba kwenye skrini ya kibao hiki.

289
00:16:49,761 --> 00:16:54,528
Ndiyo, kuna Kijapani nyingi.

290
00:16:54,551 --> 00:16:57,984
Nitakueleza sehemu muhimu tu.

291
00:16:58,007 --> 00:17:03,540
Ada ya kila mwezi na muda wa mkataba umeandikwa hapa.

292
00:17:03,563 --> 00:17:06,207
Sawa, nimeelewa.

293
00:17:06,231 --> 00:17:08,964
Bei pia ni sawa.

294
00:17:08,987 --> 00:17:16,475
Sasa, tafadhali weka sahihi ya kidigitali kwenye mstari wa chini wa mraba kwa kutumia kidole au kalamu.

295
00:17:16,499 --> 00:17:19,265
Je, nitaandika moja kwa moja kwenye skrini?

296
00:17:19,288 --> 00:17:21,767
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

297
00:17:21,791 --> 00:17:24,924
Andika jina lako.

298
00:17:24,947 --> 00:17:26,781
Sawa, nimeelewa.

299
00:17:26,804 --> 00:17:28,692
Nimeandika.

300
00:17:28,715 --> 00:17:30,392
Asante sana.

301
00:17:30,415 --> 00:17:33,058
Sasa, tutaandaa kadi SIM yako.

302
00:17:33,082 --> 00:17:37,615
Itachukua dakika kumi hivi, tafadhali ngoja kwenye kiti hiki.

303
00:17:37,638 --> 00:17:40,005
Sawa, nimeelewa.

304
00:17:40,028 --> 00:17:42,995
Umechelewa.

305
00:17:43,018 --> 00:17:47,885
Tumekuingiza kadi SIM mpya kwenye simu yako.

306
00:17:47,908 --> 00:17:53,283
Sasa tutafanya jaribio la kuunganisha mtandao.

307
00:17:53,306 --> 00:17:55,440
Sawa, naomba.

308
00:17:55,463 --> 00:17:58,396
Ninawaswaswa.

309
00:17:58,419 --> 00:18:00,952
Tazama skrini.

310
00:18:00,975 --> 00:18:03,913
Antenna imeibuka!

311
00:18:03,937 --> 00:18:07,104
Jaribu kufungua mtandao.

312
00:18:07,127 --> 00:18:11,728
Waa, ukurasa wa YouTube umefunguka mara moja.

313
00:18:11,751 --> 00:18:14,184
Ni haraka sana.

314
00:18:14,207 --> 00:18:17,207
Jaribio limefaulu.

315
00:18:17,230 --> 00:18:23,063
Sasa unaweza kutumia nambari ya simu ya Kijapani na intaneti kuanzia leo.

316
00:18:23,086 --> 00:18:24,886
Ninashangaa sana!

317
00:18:24,909 --> 00:18:29,158
Sasa nitaweza kuwasiliana na marafiki na familia mara moja.

318
00:18:29,181 --> 00:18:33,115
Asante sana kwa kunieleza vizuri.

319
00:18:33,138 --> 00:18:36,304
La, asante.

320
00:18:36,327 --> 00:18:40,220
Uwe na maisha mazuri nchini Japani.

321
00:18:40,244 --> 00:18:43,244
Mstari wa 5: Mkataba wa Chumba Kipya

322
00:18:43,244 --> 00:18:45,444
Samahani.

323
00:18:45,467 --> 00:18:49,201
Nimepanga chumba kipya.

324
00:18:49,223 --> 00:18:54,957
Leo ndio siku ya mkataba na kupokea funguo.

325
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:57,036
Karibu.

326
00:18:57,060 --> 00:18:59,497
Tumekusubiri.

327
00:18:59,521 --> 00:19:02,854
Unafanya mkataba wa chumba kipya, ndio?

328
00:19:02,877 --> 00:19:06,527
Ndiyo, naomba msaada wako.

329
00:19:06,550 --> 00:19:09,750
Ninahisi furaha kubwa!

330
00:19:09,773 --> 00:19:15,340
Kwanza, tutathibitisha maelezo ya mkataba.

331
00:19:15,363 --> 00:19:22,218
Anwani ni: Wilaya ya Shinjuku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2.

332
00:19:22,241 --> 00:19:27,309
Jina la nyumba ni Midoriso, chumba cha 201.

333
00:19:27,333 --> 00:19:30,420
Ndiyo, hakuna makosa.

334
00:19:30,443 --> 00:19:34,076
Hii ndiyo nyumba yangu mpya!

335
00:19:34,099 --> 00:19:41,156
Kodi ni shilingi 60,000 kwa mwezi, na inapaswa kulipwa kabla ya tarehe 25 kila mwezi.

336
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:44,387
Sawa, nimeelewa.

337
00:19:44,410 --> 00:19:48,489
Nitalipa kwa kujiondoa kwenye akaunti yangu ya benki.

338
00:19:48,513 --> 00:19:52,046
Muda wa mkataba ni miaka miwili.

339
00:19:52,069 --> 00:19:58,685
Ikiwa utahamia kabla ya miaka miwili, ni lazima utupe taarifa mwezi mmoja kabla.

340
00:19:58,709 --> 00:20:01,342
Mwezi mmoja kabla, ndiyo.

341
00:20:01,365 --> 00:20:03,732
Sawa, nimeelewa.

342
00:20:03,755 --> 00:20:07,635
Sasa, tutathibitisha gharama za mwanzo.

343
00:20:07,659 --> 00:20:14,508
Amani, rehani, na kodi ya mwezi wa kwanza zimethibitishwa jana.

344
00:20:14,532 --> 00:20:19,098
Ndiyo, nililipa kwa benki mtandaoni.

345
00:20:19,121 --> 00:20:22,210
Nimekubali, vizuri sana.

346
00:20:22,234 --> 00:20:29,567
Mchakato wa mkataba umekamilika, sasa nitakupatia funguo za chumba chako.

347
00:20:29,590 --> 00:20:34,157
Haya ndiyo funguo za chumba changu?

348
00:20:34,180 --> 00:20:37,151
Ninashangaa sana!

349
00:20:37,174 --> 00:20:41,108
Ndiyo, ziwe na thamani kwako.

350
00:20:41,131 --> 00:20:43,897
Usizipoteze kamwe.

351
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:47,687
Ndiyo, nitazihifadhi ndani ya begi yangu daima.

352
00:20:47,710 --> 00:20:53,768
Sasa, tutaeleza kwa ukali kanuni za kutupa taka katika nyumba hii.

353
00:20:53,792 --> 00:20:59,089
Hii ni muhimu sana. Kanuni za taka?

354
00:20:59,112 --> 00:21:04,398
Nimesikia kwamba Japani ina kanuni kali sana za kutenganisha taka.

355
00:21:04,422 --> 00:21:10,889
Ninaogopa kuwa naweza kukosea kanuni hizo.

356
00:21:10,912 --> 00:21:13,479
Usijali, hakuna matata.

357
00:21:13,502 --> 00:21:16,106
Usikose moyo.

358
00:21:16,129 --> 00:21:19,696
Kweli, kuna kanuni nyingi.

359
00:21:19,719 --> 00:21:26,175
Lazima utenganishe taka zinazowaka, taka zisizowaka, makopo, na taka za rasilimali.

360
00:21:26,199 --> 00:21:31,399
Kweli, aina nyingi hivi?

361
00:21:31,422 --> 00:21:33,708
Inaonekana ngumu.

362
00:21:33,731 --> 00:21:39,470
Pia, katika mji huu, kuna siku maalum za kutupa taka.

363
00:21:39,494 --> 00:21:45,129
Taka zinazowaka zitupwe Jumanne na Ijumaa asubuhi kabla ya saa mbili.

364
00:21:45,152 --> 00:21:48,249
Jumanne na Ijumaa, ndiyo.

365
00:21:48,273 --> 00:21:51,284
Nina wasi wasi kama nitakumbuka.

366
00:21:51,307 --> 00:21:53,374
Hakuna matata.

367
00:21:53,397 --> 00:21:59,045
Pia, tumia mifuko maalum ya taka yenye uwazi.

368
00:21:59,068 --> 00:22:02,702
Unaweza kununua katika maduka ya rejareja.

369
00:22:02,725 --> 00:22:05,263
Mifuko maalum ya taka?

370
00:22:05,287 --> 00:22:08,566
Je, siwezi kutumia mifuko yangu?

371
00:22:08,589 --> 00:22:13,556
Kama utatoa taka kwa mfuko wako mwenyewe, hatutaweza kukusanya taka hizo.

372
00:22:13,579 --> 00:22:15,465
Nimeelewa.

373
00:22:15,488 --> 00:22:18,622
Hii ni ngumu sana, kweli.

374
00:22:18,645 --> 00:22:21,845
Lakini usijali.

375
00:22:21,868 --> 00:22:28,301
Tunatoa kalenda yenye michoro ya siku za wiki kwa ajili yako.

376
00:22:28,324 --> 00:22:31,857
Haya, hii ni nini?

377
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:35,734
Michoro hii ni nzuri sana!

378
00:22:35,758 --> 00:22:42,046
Ukiona hii, utafahamu mara moja ni taka gani za siku gani zinapaswa kutolewa.

379
00:22:42,070 --> 00:22:44,436
Hii ni nzuri sana!

380
00:22:44,459 --> 00:22:49,892
Kwa hii, nitaweza kutolea taka bila kukosea.

381
00:22:49,915 --> 00:22:52,315
Sawa, nzuri sana.

382
00:22:52,338 --> 00:22:55,778
Ni vizuri kuiweka kwenye ukuta wa chumba chako.

383
00:22:55,802 --> 00:22:57,256
Sawa.

384
00:22:57,280 --> 00:23:00,213
Nitaiweka mara moja kwenye ukuta wa chumba changu.

385
00:23:00,236 --> 00:23:03,878
Sasa nina hamu sana na maisha mapya.

386
00:23:03,902 --> 00:23:07,469
Uwe mzuri!

387
00:23:07,492 --> 00:23:11,368
Kama una tatizo lolote, wasiliana na ofisi ya nyumba wakati wowote.

388
00:23:11,391 --> 00:23:13,263
Sawa.

389
00:23:13,287 --> 00:23:15,087
Asante sana.

390
00:23:15,110 --> 00:23:17,283
Nitakwenda sasa.

391
00:23:17,307 --> 00:23:20,307
Sehemu ya 6: Mchakato wa Kuanzisha Umeme

392
00:23:20,307 --> 00:23:25,798
Halo, leo nimehamia katika ghorofa mpya.

393
00:23:25,821 --> 00:23:29,555
Ninataka kufanya mchakato wa kuanzisha umeme.

394
00:23:29,578 --> 00:23:32,631
Asante kwa kupiga simu.

395
00:23:32,655 --> 00:23:36,348
Hii ni Kituo cha Msaada cha Umeme Tokyo.

396
00:23:36,371 --> 00:23:39,827
Unaanza kutumia umeme mpya, hivyo?

397
00:23:39,851 --> 00:23:42,518
Ndiyo, ni hivyo.

398
00:23:42,541 --> 00:23:49,382
Kwa sababu sijakuona uso wako kwa njia ya simu, nina wasiwasi kidogo.

399
00:23:49,405 --> 00:23:51,692
Usijali, hakuna matata.

400
00:23:51,716 --> 00:23:55,887
Je, maneno yangu ni wazi?

401
00:23:55,910 --> 00:23:59,284
Nitazungumza polepole.

402
00:23:59,307 --> 00:24:01,604
Ndiyo, ninaelewa vizuri.

403
00:24:01,627 --> 00:24:03,394
Asante sana.

404
00:24:03,417 --> 00:24:09,893
Kwanza, tafadhali nipe anwani yako mpya na jina lako.

405
00:24:09,916 --> 00:24:20,316
Anwani yangu ni Shinjuku-ku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2, Midori-so, chumba cha 201.

406
00:24:20,339 --> 00:24:29,272
Shinjuku-ku, Nishi-Shinjuku 3-1-2, Midori-so, chumba cha 201, ndivyo?

407
00:24:29,295 --> 00:24:31,295
Nimehakikisha.

408
00:24:31,318 --> 00:24:35,086
Jina langu ni Maria.

409
00:24:35,110 --> 00:24:37,361
Maria, ndivyo?

410
00:24:37,384 --> 00:24:39,123
Asante sana.

411
00:24:39,147 --> 00:24:44,001
Sasa, tafadhali nipe nambari yako ya simu.

412
00:24:44,024 --> 00:24:52,458
Bado sina simu ya mkononi ya Kijapani, je, ninaweza kutumia nambari ya shule yangu ya Kijapani?

413
00:24:52,481 --> 00:24:57,540
Ndiyo, nambari ya shule itatosha.

414
00:24:57,563 --> 00:24:59,763
Tafadhali nipe.

415
00:24:59,786 --> 00:25:06,192
Nambari ni 03-1234-5678.

416
00:25:06,216 --> 00:25:08,259
Asante sana.

417
00:25:08,283 --> 00:25:10,335
Tumerekodi.

418
00:25:10,358 --> 00:25:16,200
Je, tarehe ya kuanzisha umeme ni leo, Julai 9?

419
00:25:16,224 --> 00:25:20,390
Ndiyo, nataka kuanza kutumia leo.

420
00:25:20,413 --> 00:25:25,348
Sasa niko ndani ya chumba, lakini umeme hauwasi.

421
00:25:25,372 --> 00:25:28,542
Ni giza sana.

422
00:25:28,566 --> 00:25:30,232
Nimeelewa.

423
00:25:30,255 --> 00:25:34,661
Sasa tutaanzisha umeme ili uweze kutumia.

424
00:25:34,685 --> 00:25:38,019
Sawa, nifanye nini?

425
00:25:38,042 --> 00:25:42,685
Tafadhali inua breka katika chumba chako.

426
00:25:42,708 --> 00:25:46,475
Eeh, breka?

427
00:25:46,498 --> 00:25:49,031
Hiyo ni nini?

428
00:25:49,054 --> 00:25:51,489
Sijui vizuri.

429
00:25:51,512 --> 00:25:58,046
Breka ni sanduku nyeusi lenye swichi nyingi za umeme.

430
00:25:58,069 --> 00:26:00,935
Sanduku nyeusi?

431
00:26:00,958 --> 00:26:03,592
Iko wapi?

432
00:26:03,615 --> 00:26:05,748
Sioni.

433
00:26:05,771 --> 00:26:13,611
Kwa kawaida, huwa juu ya ukuta karibu na ingilio, chumba cha kufulia nguo, au karibu na jiko.

434
00:26:13,635 --> 00:26:16,310
Je, ni juu ya mlango wa kuingia?

435
00:26:16,333 --> 00:26:19,344
Nitatafuta kidogo.

436
00:26:19,367 --> 00:26:23,101
Aa, kuna sanduku fulani.

437
00:26:23,124 --> 00:26:26,257
Je, ni sanduku lenye swichi iliyoingizwa?

438
00:26:26,280 --> 00:26:29,613
Fungua kifuniko tafadhali.

439
00:26:29,636 --> 00:26:31,836
Nimefungua.

440
00:26:31,859 --> 00:26:35,793
Kuna swichi ndogo ndani ya hiyo.

441
00:26:35,816 --> 00:26:40,073
Swichi kubwa zaidi iko kwenye hali ya 'kufungwa'?

442
00:26:40,096 --> 00:26:42,630
Weka kwenye hali ya 'kuwashwa' tafadhali.

443
00:26:42,654 --> 00:26:45,187
Iko kwenye hali ya 'kufungwa'.

444
00:26:45,210 --> 00:26:48,277
Je, ni lazima nipandishie juu?

445
00:26:48,300 --> 00:26:52,306
Ndiyo, pandisha juu tafadhali.

446
00:26:52,329 --> 00:26:54,339
Sawa, nimeelewa.

447
00:26:54,362 --> 00:26:56,647
Nafanya hivi na hofu kidogo.

448
00:26:56,671 --> 00:26:58,690
Nitapandisha sasa.

449
00:26:58,713 --> 00:27:03,286
Eeh! Waa, umeme umewashwa ghafla.

450
00:27:03,310 --> 00:27:06,276
Chumba kimewaa na nuru sana.

451
00:27:06,299 --> 00:27:08,533
Sawa, nzuri sana.

452
00:27:08,556 --> 00:27:12,233
Sasa umeme umeunganishwa vizuri.

453
00:27:12,256 --> 00:27:13,825
Asante sana.

454
00:27:13,848 --> 00:27:17,582
